{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：19:54 2026-09-05 HKT</p>\n\n<p>前男子組合「天堂鳥」成員葉泓聲早前被內地網紅訪問，受訪時公開其月租4,5000元，市值2,000萬的千呎豪宅，影片被轉載到Threads，即引來網民討論。現時葉泓聲與老婆陳樂榣，加上兩名女兒、父母及家傭同住，片中可見，屋內裝潢簡約溫馨，客廳空間寬敞，擺放了舒適的湖水綠色大梳化及按摩椅，大窗旁更可遠眺紅館，採光度極佳。如此舒適的居住環境，令不少網民大感驚訝，認為他雖然知名度不高，卻似乎收入不少，紛紛留言：「天堂鳥都咁有米？」、「重點係佢住得起 45,000 月租」、「做咁多年冇乜人識都咁搵到錢，唔怪得個個都發明星夢」。</p>\n<h2>葉泓聲寓所望紅館勉勵自己</h2>\n<p>在曝光的家居細節中，客廳擺放着由粉絲親手送贈的紅館樂高模型，象徵着他的舞台夢。葉泓聲還大方展示了他自 2014 年出道以來的珍貴相冊，其中更驚現國際巨星王嘉爾中學時期的照片，原來兩人是舊同學，當年曾一起練舞。近年葉泓聲除了幕前演出，亦全力照顧家庭，主臥室的隱形門大衣櫃均留給兩個女兒和太太，自己僅分得化妝枱旁的一小格，甚至要在太太的化妝枱架設麥克風以便隨時練歌。</p>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲與陳樂榣組成五口之家。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6c3f496dc339ea96ee79d57cefca1b9d/2026-02/gordon_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲與陳樂榣早前表示去泰國「窮遊」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be65259e4f50144611d880642abfc146/2026-02/yip_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲表示行程由陳樂榣安排。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c9b638c9e9098dde024d91f28b556d2b/2026-02/yip_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲問老婆陳樂榣又話窮遊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/10321f2f9c9298930215c62ca0cc7b59/2026-02/yip_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳樂榣稱落機好攰，第一餐要食好一點。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/662219fd84b360613a6e3948b246048c/2026-02/yip_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲食沙律。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0b1277843ca1fb81b62211b114821794/2026-02/yip_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳樂榣之後帶去購物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bb5498024490f429caa76a6e9731a6ad/2026-02/yip_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲睇中特別版索價4,000港元。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/66ead4d9fd90ae43a3b81d741b381f43/2026-02/yip_33_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲與陳樂榣等位食船麵。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f29aaeda1f06a9136deb9b931772a80c/2026-02/yip_36_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲因為太辣，食到變臉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d792d450a65c25a4c17f8b941bb7084/2026-02/yip_40_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲指太太陳樂榣帶去的按摩店唔平。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac3aa9162c4b939e9a74e705a3e354b5/2026-02/yip_45_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"因為陳樂榣上次有錢剩，所以不用再付費。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5b92b36adae783f017271cc1f0ce4aef/2026-02/yip_48_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲與陳樂榣行夜市。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fd999cf7fcf856b70156dacd092eb5c0/2026-02/yip_50_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲與陳樂榣排隊買人氣店蛋糕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/162cbb5ecf593afe784375811939da67/2026-02/yip_54_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳樂榣餵老公葉泓聲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f70802d3ffd85f2e00f49ad78fa4a108/2026-02/yip_60_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>葉泓聲自豪發達靠聽老婆話</h2>\n<p>事實上，葉泓聲擁有幸福生活，背後絕對少不了賢內助陳樂榣的支持。葉泓聲在片中笑言「老婆最大，老婆說了算」、「聽老婆話先至會發達」，足見兩人感情甜蜜。陳樂榣不僅把家庭打理得井井有條，其個人珠寶事業亦蒸蒸日上。她於 2013 年由網店起家，創立本地首飾品牌「WOW FASHION JEWELLERY」，當年僅以小型 Showroom 形式展示新品，其後成功開設實體專賣店，現時品牌在香港及九龍區均設有首飾專門店，生意越做越好。陳樂榣早前曾透露，現時正籌備再開分店，家庭與事業兩得意。</p>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲（Gordon）2021年簽約成為TVB旗下藝人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/181b6a01df4e9773a2810f4a125f2dc0/2024-05/gordon2_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲在日本向陳樂榣跪地求婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/10d219aa414346a4c125ff93fa7f576f/2023-09/gordon2ok_353613297_1316147972652142_2682864754736796802_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲與陳樂榣的婚禮在BB出生後才補辦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/de32b27c998127ae6197c6ff6f9cee42/2023-09/gordon2ok_353026857_945911453317469_9132244263599583989_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲與陳樂榣2024年結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/290c530e869992e02510f764f4543065/2024-11/03__2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲對太太陳樂榣情深一吻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ee092409e7c46210e7b127f530f6e4d/2024-11/02__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲無預警宣布婚訊後，晒出陳樂榣孕照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/80567c572277e586b95c086be76bf454/2023-05/unknown_348847848_468611265461140_4106306872620940236_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳樂榣曾分享孕照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4576914dca77750d572dca408704feaf/2023-05/unknown_349067985_748248053706884_6065803008651796966_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳樂榣大讚葉泓聲對大女愛護有加。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0191d5f4e5b8a22854d0cd8f7b42b805/2023-05/unknown_349222594_265875066002702_1332347047361052871_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳樂榣與前夫的女兒Aria、葉泓聲的囡囡Mia到場見證。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/45617d077b0c4a892a68a561716b8e17/2024-11/01_Gordon_Ally_Aria_Mia_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲與陳樂榣密密造人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c9e8840e6570a92fb914b9a7da417ad1/2024-12/Ally_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳樂榣前兩次懷孕未正式影過大肚寫真。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/399818d1ea99c406ed341e1fe3def488/2024-12/Ally_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳樂榣帶同愛貓影相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/57524922ed64762cb48be20b87ff27a6/2024-12/Ally_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳樂榣一家三口影靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00e83b51afa6c6d70539d802872b36d5/2024-12/Ally_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳樂榣與前夫的女兒，也有一同影全家福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1cb7c66b0e9a194f0f6841ffb008a56/2024-12/Ally_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳樂榣肥肚不肥人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/31ec6bbf7afcbf1fa293112233d9a639/2024-12/Ally_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲感恩太太生下女兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6bb425f2e61d8ca6ce3e777968d2e1c6/2023-09/Gordon_08.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兒子與爸爸似足餅印。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3e1ae840c906fef8bdd3384234304705/2025-01/gordon2ok_1736773055_3544631755410342523_49843126.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲已做爸爸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3d32fde2a9b5dcc9bef486abafaa8a27/2024-03/900.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲是新手爸爸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eaaaf711fa075cfd7e6bc6eb15d3204a/2024-03/400020574_18393806074051127_3263491149000523216_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲對Gia很有耐性，經常唱歌、講故事及陪伴女兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d703538b84d510f1d73b1b6549acd791/2024-03/395823318_18390655069051127_3517502997054543705_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲喜歡小朋友，對可愛女兒Gia寵愛有加。  \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a4371f402edc0f893343da758d4a75e6/2024-03/901.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲與陳樂榣曾為Gia舉行百日宴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ca9b5eb44b2c3b230a059dfe048de451/2024-03/1003.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"葉泓聲與陳樂榣一家人好幸福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0601619ee07c7d4ab6f5ce48af336da3/2024-03/426020880_18414872470013513_8740316784532212747_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"前天堂鳥成員葉泓聲（Gordon）與太太陳樂榣（Ally）前年誕下囡囡Gia。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/214aac8ddfd911a8650e3ee1fb57ac37/2024-09/VS--AllyChanHappy1yearsoldbirthdaybabyGiaweloveyoualwaysbabygiababygirlbabymochioneyearoldInstagram-0_00_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Freeze前成員陳樂榣（Ally）2023年宣布與前天堂鳥成員葉泓聲（Gordon）再婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f3048bc83b01abded28291e350f8469/2024-09/3_5_16.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T11:58:12.716750+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":735,"images":40,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}